.TITLE "passwd"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Changes a user's password. It updates the __authentication credentials__ for the current or specified user account on the local system.

.DIV "ALIAS"

.DIV "TLDR"
**passwd**
Changes the password for the currently logged-in user.
> 

**sudo passwd user**
Changes the password for a specific user account using administrative privileges.
> __user__ target username

.DIV "SUMMARY"
On macOS, user passwords are synchronized with the login keychain. While __passwd__ updates the system account, you may still need to update your keychain manually if the two become out of sync.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**mac:sudo** **mac:whoami**

documentation: __https://ss64.com/osx/passwd.html__
